aionnich/README.md:11:- [2025/11] [AICB](https://github.com/aliyun/aicb/tree/master) now supports generating **prefill/decode** inference workloads for **DeepSeek**, **Qwen3-MoE** and **Qwen3-Next**.
aionnich/README.md:13:- [2025/09] [AICB](https://github.com/aliyun/aicb/tree/master) now supports generating training workloads for DeepSeek. Thanks to [@parthpower](https://github.com/parthpower) for this contribution.
